 style="font-size: var(--font-size-2xs); letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: var(--color-text-faint);">THR</span><div style="width: 14px; height: 100px; border: 1px solid var(--color-surface-raised); background: var(--color-surface-app); position: relative; overflow: hidden;"><div style="position: absolute; bottom: 0px; left: 0px; right: 0px; background: var(--color-accent-fg); transition: height 80ms linear; height: 100%;"></div></div><span style="font-size: var(--font-size-xs); color: var(--color-text-primary); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;"><span>100 <span data-unit="%" title="percent"><span aria-hidden="true">%</span><span data-unit-word=""> percent</span></span></span></span></div></div><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-8); padding-top: var(--space-6); border-top: 1px solid var(--color-surface-raised);"><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-4);"><div style="font-size: var(--font-size-2xs); letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-text-faint);">SAS</div><div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(48px, 1fr)); gap: var(--space-4);"><button type="button" aria-pressed="true">SAS ON</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false">RCS OFF</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false" disabled="">PRECISION</button></div></div><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-4);"><div style="font-size: var(--font-size-2xs); letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-text-faint);">SAS Mode</div><div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(48px, 1fr)); gap: var(--space-4);"><button type="button" aria-pressed="true">SAS</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false">PRO</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false">RET</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false">NOR</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false">ANT</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false">RIN</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false">ROU</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false">TGT</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false">ATG</button><button type="button" aria-pressed="false">MNV</button></div></div><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-4);"><div style="font-size: var(--font-size-2xs); letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-text-faint);">Throttle</div><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-8);"><input type="range" min="0" max="1" step="0.01" aria-label="Throttle" style="flex: 1 1 0%;" value="1"><span style="font-size: var(--font-size-xs); color: var(--color-text-primary); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; min-width: 36px; text-align: right;"><span>100 <span data-unit="%" title="percent"><span aria-hidden="true">%</span><span data-unit-word=""> percent</span></span></span></span></div><div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(48px, 1fr)); gap: var(--space-4);"><button type="button">ZERO</button><button type="button">−10%</button><button type="button">+10%</button><button type="button">FULL</button></div></div><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-4);"><div style="font-size: var(--font-size-2xs); letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--color-text-faint);">Fly-by-wire</div><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-8);"><button type="button" aria-pressed="false">Arm FBW</button><span style="font-size: var(--font-size-2xs); color: var(--color-text-faint);">Bind axes via the Inputs tab, then arm to take stick control.</span></div></div></div></div></div><div></div><div></div></div></div>"`;

exports[`Navball widget DOM snapshots > launchpad-vertical @ landscape-18x5 1`] = `"<div><div><div data-panel-body=""><div data-panel-header=""><div><h3>ATTITUDE</h3></div><div><details data-panel-aside-expand="" open=""><summary aria-label="Panel status and controls"><span data-panel-aside-chevron="" aria-hidden="true"></span></summary><div data-panel-aside-full=""><div style="display: flex; gap: var(--space-4); flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: flex-end; min-width: 0px;"><span style="font-size: var(--font-size-2xs); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em; padding: var(--space-hair) var(--space-6); border-radius: var(--radius-xs); background: var(--color-status-go-bg); color: var(--color-status-go-fg);">SAS: StabilityAssist</span><span style="font-size: var(--font-size-2xs); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em; padding: var(--space-hair) var(--space-6); border-radius: var(--radius-xs); background: var(--color-surface-raised); color: var(--color-text-faint);">RCS</span></div></div></details></div></div><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-8); margin-top: var(--space-8); flex: 1 1 0%; min-height: 0px;"><div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-4); flex: 1 1 0%; justify-content: center;"><div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: var(--space-8);"><span style="font-size: var(--font-size-2xs); letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: var(--color-text-faint); min-width: 28px;">HDG</span><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--color-text-primary); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; letter-spacing: 0.04em;"><span>90<span data-unit="°" title="degrees"><span aria-hidden="true">°</span><span data-unit-word=""> degrees</span></span></span></span></div><div style="display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: var(--space-8);"><span style="font-size: var(--font-size-2xs); letter-spacing: 0.12em; color: var(--color-text-faint); min-width: 28px;">PCH</span><span style="font-size: 18px; font-weight